1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,291
Height is like a state function.

2
00:00:02,291 --> 00:00:10,364
Pressure, volume, temperature and internal energy are state functions: they depend only on the present state.

3
00:00:10,364 --> 00:00:13,424
Distance walked is like a path function.

4
00:00:13,424 --> 00:00:17,812
Heat and work are path functions: they depend on the route taken.

5
00:00:17,812 --> 00:00:21,523
That is why we write delta U, but never delta Q.

